    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e660046f8af72add7cd8f0ba",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那么，今天要做什么呢？\n什么都行哦，如果是现在的话……\n感觉能超越“自我”的壁垒。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2be7be7eb5b123a9a687d378b514c5cc5116c866d544e87f60c7ff339bc6c18",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
