      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在你看来，现在的我如何？\n……不，不用回答。那双闪耀着\n金色光芒的眼眸——就是答案。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3d45217ebfc7bd49deeb4ae385f029de2d7cdd42731eed882a54022e9c7d890",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
