      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "或许会在某些糟糕的方向上，\n破坏掉重要的蹄印……\n但我并不打算退缩。我会挣扎给你看的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "00d697e8dca3181c1477ade10e24574ab693a674a2d0231dd5c974f75b62e16b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
