      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一切都会按它该有的样子发展。\n悔恨逝去的时光也无法挽回……\n咽下这一切，继续前进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f08628fea0f7a53c623b87584eee938838b1cdcc4be68ab254d0ec248fd962c4",
